  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UNESCO-UNAM Jaime Torres Bodet prize in social sciences, humanities an</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This prize, sponsored by the National Autonomous University of Mexico (Universidad Nacional Aut&#xf3;noma de M&#xe9;xico, UNAM) was approved by the Executive Board of UNESCO at its 195th session, on 27 October 2014. The Prize, which consists of a monetary reward of US $50,000, would be awarded every two years with a view to rewarding the efforts of a person, group of people or international institution that have contributed to the development of knowledge and society through art, teaching and research in social sciences and humanities.</narrative>
  </description>
